<title>USA: Benton Oil to list on NYSE.</title>
<headline>Benton Oil to list on NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>CARPINTERIA, Calif. 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Benton Oil and Gas on Monday said it has applied to list its stock on the New York Stock Exchange (NYSE).</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said it expects its shares will begin trading on the NYSE by the end of April under the symbol BNO.</p>
<p>Benton shares currently are trading on the Nasdaq stock market under the symbol BNTN.</p>
</text>
